---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About Us"
  description="Promote Waipu is a non-profit community group with all proceeds from our activities fed directly back into the local Waipu community."
>

  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fw-bold">About Promote Waipu</h1>
      <p>Community-led, community-funded, community-proud</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
  <section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="section-title h3">Who We Are</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Promote Waipu, officially known as Waipu Business and Community Inc,
            is a non-profit community group with all proceeds from our activities
            fed directly back into the Waipu community.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our committee is made up of passionate business people and local residents
            all with a strong community spirit. While we do have our own range of
            entertaining events — such as the ever-popular Christmas Eve Street Parade,
            five massive Street &amp; Park Markets throughout the year, and the Winter in
            Waipu programme throughout July — we pride ourselves on being the only local
            organisation focused on supporting and promoting the entire Waipu community.
          </p>
          <p>
            We also successfully manage and/or support local beautification projects and
            have good lines of communication with local bodies and Government Agencies.
            Our ultimate goal is to assist in promoting Waipu as the most desirable place
            to live, work and play!
          </p>
          <p>
            Promote Waipu actively encourages community participation — by volunteering
            at local events, becoming a Promote Waipu business member (our base website
            listing is free to all Waipu-based businesses), or joining our friendly
            committee. We'd love you to be part of our wider family!
          </p>
          <p>
            For more information, email
            <a href="mailto:secretary@promotewaipu.co.nz">secretary@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <img src="/images/waipu-village.jpg"
               alt="Waipu village"
               class="img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm mb-4" />
          <div class="card border-0 bg-sand rounded-3 p-4">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-1">
              <i class="bi bi-envelope-fill text-primary me-2"></i>Get in Touch
            </h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">
              <a href="mailto:hello@promotewaipu.co.nz">hello@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>
            </p>
            <p class="small mb-0">
              <a href="mailto:secretary@promotewaipu.co.nz">secretary@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OUR COMMUNITY -->
  <section class="py-5 bg-sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <img src="/images/waipu-cove.jpg"
               alt="Waipu Cove beach"
               class="img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="section-title h3">Our Community</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Just 90 minutes north of Auckland and 30 minutes south of Whangarei,
            Waipu is situated on one of the most stunning coastlines in New Zealand.
          </p>
          <p>
            With a population of around 3,000, Waipu welcomes visitors with its
            uniquely friendly, charming and laid-back lifestyle. Come summer time,
            holiday-makers flock to experience iconic Kiwi beaches, cafes, restaurants
            and specialty shops — loving it just as much as we do!
          </p>
          <p>
            Waipu is rich in Scottish history and plays host to many annual events
            including the New Year's Day Highland Games and the Winter in Waipu
            Tartan Festival month. It has a thriving events calendar with the ever
            popular Street Markets, Easter Carnival and famous Christmas Eve Street
            Parade, which always draws a spectacular crowd.
          </p>
          <a href="/explore" class="btn btn-primary me-2">
            <i class="bi bi-compass me-1"></i> Explore the Area
          </a>
          <a href="/events" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
            <i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i> See Events
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- JOIN CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Be Part of Something Good</h2>
      <p class="lead mb-4" style="max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 1.5rem">
        All profits of Promote Waipu membership and website listings are used to
        promote Waipu and support local community events.
      </p>
      <a href="/join" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold me-2 mb-2">
        <i class="bi bi-people-fill me-1"></i> Join Us Today
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg mb-2">
        <i class="bi bi-chat-fill me-1"></i> Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
